# Milestone 018-embedded-proxy-oidc — Completed

## Summary

Added OpenID Connect (OIDC) JWT Bearer-token verification to the DRL embedded proxy.
DRL acts exclusively as an OAuth 2.0 Resource Server: it validates tokens using OIDC discovery +
JWKS, enforces scope requirements per route, and injects verified claims into request context for
the accounting layer. All OIDC logic is self-contained inside `internal/proxy/` with no changes
to `internal/cmd/`.

---

## New dependency

- `github.com/coreos/go-oidc/v3 v3.18.0` — OIDC discovery, thread-safe JWKS caching, and
  cryptographic signature verification. Transitively brings in `golang.org/x/oauth2` and
  `github.com/go-jose/go-jose/v4`.

