## Tests (`internal/proxy/middleware_oidc_test.go`)

28 new tests in package `proxy` (white-box). A self-contained mock OIDC provider is implemented
using `net/http/httptest` + `crypto/rsa` + manual RS256 JWT construction (no external test
dependencies). The mock exposes `/.well-known/openid-configuration` and `/jwks`.

| Test | Scenario |
|------|----------|
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_MissingToken` | No Authorization header → 401 |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_InvalidSignature` | JWT signed with a different key → 401 |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_ExpiredToken` | `exp` in the past → 401 |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_AudienceMismatch` | Wrong `aud` claim → 403 |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_MissingRequiredScope` | Token has `read`, route needs `write` → 403 |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_ValidToken_PassThrough` | Valid token with correct scopes → 200 |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_RequireAuthFalse_NoCheck` | Public route, no token needed → 200 |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_ClaimsInjectedInContext` | `sub` and `scopes` available downstream |
| `TestOIDCMiddleware_ArrayScopesClaim` | JSON-array scope claim satisfies requirements |
| `TestOIDCMetrics_Registered` | New metrics fields non-nil, methods don't panic |
| `TestExtractStringSliceClaim_*` (×4) | Space / comma / array / missing field |
| `TestHasRequiredScopes_*` (×3) | All present / missing / empty required |
| `TestClassifyOIDCError` (×3 subtests) | expired / signature / generic error mapping |

All 37 proxy tests pass (35 pre-existing + 2 new from this milestone's test additions via
integration run).

